  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Troefcall. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Troefcall is a 4-player partnership trick-taking game from Suriname, also popular in the Netherlands. The 'trump caller' gets 5 cards first and declares trump. Teams try to win 7+ tricks. Winning first 7 in a row = 'Kap Partij' (5 pts). All 13 = 'Baunie' (15 pts). If Baunie attempted but failed, opponents score 2.",
    objective: 'Win the majority of tricks (at least 7 of 13) and be the first team to reach the agreed target score (e.g. 15, 20, or 50 points).',
    gameplay: 'Trump caller leads. Follow suit. Trump if void. Win 7+ tricks for points. Kap Partij: Win first 7 consecutive = 5 pts. Baunie: Win all 13 = 15 pts. Failed Baunie = opponents get 2.',
